#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""claude-stuffer: staff a Claude Code project with a team of subagents.

Team by seniority: the main session is the architect (Fable); the global bench
(senior/Opus, mid/Sonnet, junior/Haiku, plus reviewer, qa and scout) lives in
~/.claude/agents; each project gets its own domain roles in .claude/agents.

  claude-stuffer            interview in the current folder, then write the team
  claude-stuffer init       install or update the global bench in ~/.claude
  claude-stuffer show       print the project's current team

Standard library only. Never deletes a file; never overwrites a file it did not
generate. See https://github.com/kpatr1981/claude-stuffer
"""

